@startuml target-architecture
title Target Architecture — Phase 1 (Fabric)

skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

database "Google Sheets\n(Despesas_Reais_DB)" as Sheets
folder "SharePoint\n(Budget_*.xlsx)" as SharePoint

package "Microsoft Fabric — Despesas-DEV workspace" {
  folder "Lakehouse\n(DespesasDEV_Landing)\nraw file landing only" as Lakehouse
  database "Warehouse\n(GestaoDespesasDW)\nstg / dw / dbo (views)" as Warehouse

  rectangle "Pipeline: PL_Despesas_Master\n(scheduled — 12h DEV / 6h PROD)" as Pipeline {
    [Copy Data:\nSharePoint -> Lakehouse] as CopyData
    [Notebook:\n04_ingest_budget] as NBBudget
    [Notebook:\n02_ingest_despesas] as NBDespesas
    [Activity:\n03_notificar_telegram] as NBTelegram
    [Activity:\n05_obras_report] as NBObras
    [Notebook:\n01_ingest_feriados] as NBFeriados
    [Script:\nupdate dw.Meta_Controlo] as ScriptMeta
  }
}

queue "Telegram Bot API" as Telegram
cloud "SMTP (Email)" as SMTP
[Power BI\n(Import mode,\nWarehouse SQL endpoint)] as PBI

SharePoint --> CopyData : Organizational account auth
CopyData --> Lakehouse : raw xlsx (Binary copy)
Lakehouse --> NBBudget : reads via /lakehouse/default/Files
NBBudget --> Warehouse : stg.Budget -> sp_ProcessarBudget

Sheets --> NBDespesas : gspread (service account)
NBDespesas --> Warehouse : stg.DespesasReais -> sp_ProcessarDespesasReais

Warehouse --> NBTelegram : SELECT WHERE Notificado_Telegram = 0
NBTelegram --> Telegram : one message per expense
NBTelegram --> Warehouse : UPDATE Notificado_Telegram = 1

Warehouse --> NBObras : SELECT WHERE Notificado_Email = 0
NBObras --> Lakehouse : saves PDF
NBObras --> SMTP : sends email
NBObras --> Warehouse : UPDATE Notificado_Email = 1

Warehouse --> NBFeriados : year range from fact tables
NBFeriados --> Warehouse : dbo.FeriadosPT, dbo.Dim_Calendario

NBTelegram --> ScriptMeta : On Completion
NBObras --> ScriptMeta : On Completion
NBFeriados --> ScriptMeta : On Completion
ScriptMeta --> Warehouse : dw.Meta_Controlo timestamp

Warehouse --> PBI : dbo.vw_* views (Import mode)

note right of Pipeline
  Independent activities.
  A Telegram/Obras failure
  no longer blocks data loading.
end note

@enduml
